"_112":1242},[],"Multiple indoor and outdoor entertaining areas","3a9fa4e6b67a",[1246],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1247,"_112":602},[],"9e79372099b2",[1251],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1252,"_112":143},[],"3a9fa2e060d4",[1256],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1257,"_112":1068},[],"fdaddf99d9a1",[1261],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1262,"_112":1074},[],"9e629aeafb66",[1266],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1267,"_112":1268},[],"Premium marble and natural stone throughout","e5cf8968932b",[1272],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1273,"_112":1086},[],"c97a58816d63",[1277],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1278,"_112":1098},[],"d57d39bde4f5",[1282],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1283,"_112":1092},[],"12834a1e2883",[1287],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1288,"_112":1110},[],"ef6b92bd34cc",[1292],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1293,"_112":1116},[],"23a12f193411",[1297],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1298,"_112":1122},[],"de574eb36a64",[1302],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1303,"_112":1304},[],"Prestigious golf course frontage","6bc0db9aab57",[1308],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1309,"_112":1310},[],"Approximately 560sqm (60 Squares) custom residence","e311ce228169",[1314],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1315,"_112":186},[],"2839ad7792ad",[1319],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1320,"_112":1321},[],"By managing every stage of the project—from design coordination and approvals through to construction and final handover—we delivered a residence that exceeds expectations in both quality and design.","6ca1b477e11e",[1325],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1326,"_112":1327},[],"The home features a dramatic double-height entrance, a custom spiral staircase, premium natural stone finishes, bespoke joinery and expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing that frames the surrounding golf course. A resort-style swimming pool and spa create a seamless connection between the indoor living spaces and the outdoor entertaining area, while every material and finish was carefully selected to deliver a timeless, luxurious home.","21f58fd85f3c",[1331],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1332,"_112":1333},[],"Working closely with the client from concept through to completion, Siari Build delivered a bespoke residence that combines sophisticated architectural design with superior craftsmanship.","c1bf7876449a",[1337],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1338,"_112":204},[],"0e9fe8d1d23f",[1342],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1343,"_112":1344},[],"Executing these design ambitions demanded meticulous planning, precision construction and exceptional attention to detail across every stage of the project.","8e1a3fec833b",[1348],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1349,"_112":1350},[],"The vision was to create a statement residence that maximised its premium golf course location while delivering uncompromising luxury and everyday practicality. The design required expansive open-plan living, abundant natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor integration and premium architectural detailing throughout, while maintaining privacy, energy efficiency and timeless appeal.","377ee23dc1ca",[1354],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1355,"_112":222},[],"a581b14364f3",[1359],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1360,"_112":1361},[],"Positioned within the prestigious Sanctuary Lakes estate overlooking the golf course, the home seamlessly integrates indoor and outdoor living through floor-to-ceiling glazing, a resort-style swimming pool and spa, and generous entertaining spaces. Every aspect of the residence has been meticulously designed to create a home that is both luxurious and functional.","af2624f57fe4",[1365],[],{"_93":1229,"_95":109,"_110":1366,"_112":1367},[],"The Tiffany Walk Residence is a luxury custom home designed to deliver timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship and resort-style family living. Spanning approximately 560sqm (60 Squares), this residence showcases premium finishes, expansive living spaces and carefully considered architectural details throughout.","6d3fc6ef7496",